{
  "job_B8.1.4.2_20251003_114807": {
    "chunk_text": "nu gyt eow Drihten ne ondr\u00e6da\u00f0. Witodlice eal heora fleax & heora beras w\u00e6ron fordone, for \u00feam \u00fee hi w\u00e6ron on \u00f0a tid grene. \u00d0a Moyses eode ut of \u00f0\u00e6re byrig fram Pharaone, he ahof up his hand to Drihtne, & se hagol & \u00f0a So\u00f0lice \u00fea Pharao geseah \u00fe\u00e6t se hagol & \u00f0a \u00f0unorrada geswicon, \u00fea ihte he eft his synna. & his heorte & his folces w\u00e6s ahyrd, & he nolde forl\u00e6tan \u00fe\u00e6t Israhelisce folc, swa God him bebead & DRIHTEN cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Moyse: Ga in to Pharaone & ic ahyrde his heortan & his folces, \u00fe\u00e6t hi nella\u00f0 & telle \u00feinum suna & \u00f0inum magum, hu oft ic h\u00e6bbe fordon \u00fea Egyptiscan & worhte mine wundru Moyses & Aaron eodon in to Pharaone, & cw\u00e6don to him: Forl\u00e6t Godes folc, \u00f0\u00e6t hit offrige him \u00f0as So\u00f0lice gyf \u00f0u min folc forl\u00e6tan nelt, nu to morgen ic sende g\u00e6rstapan ofer eall \u00f0in rice, & ofer ealle & hi gefylla\u00f0 \u00feine hus & \u00feinra \u00f0egna & ealles \u00f0ines folces ofer eall Egypta land, & swa fela heora bi\u00f0 Witodlice Pharaones \u00f0egnas cw\u00e6don to him: Hu lange sceolon we \u00f0olian \u00f0as yrm\u00f0u; Forl\u00e6t \u00f0as men, & hi clypodon ongean Moyses & Aaron, & cw\u00e6don: Hu fela manna wille ge on eowrum cynne, \u00fe\u00e6t Moyses him andwyrde & cw\u00e6\u00f0: We willa\u00f0 faran mid wifum & mid cildum, mid ealdum & mid \u00d0a and",
